BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_18c46c0a-835f-3eaa-a960-31b7780a712e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
